version: v5.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-22"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/SyedRafiAhmedGIS/AnyDisasterMapping"
url: "https://github.com/SyedRafiAhmedGIS/AnyDisasterMapping"
abstract: >-
  A unified PyTorch codebase for Earth-observation disaster mapping: 24
  registered benchmark datasets across 13 disaster domains (segmentation,
  change detection, and semantic change detection), 34 model
  implementations, one-command smoke tests, an export/ONNX path, and a
  17-notebook Colab collection sharing a single tested core
  (tools/colab_kit.py).
keywords:
  - remote sensing
  - disaster mapping
  - change detection
  - semantic segmentation
  - benchmark
  - deep learning
